{"seq":2,"slug":"scaling-challenges","title":"规模化挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/migration-and-scale/scaling-challenges","wordCount":945,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"规模化挑战\">规模化挑战</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Monorepo 规模增长的瓶颈来自三个维度，每个维度都有对应的优化手段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>瓶颈</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>主要优化手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IDE 性能</td>\n<td>编辑器卡顿、类型检查缓慢</td>\n<td><code>skipLibCheck</code>、<code>incremental</code>、排除配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Git 性能</td>\n<td>clone / status / log 变慢</td>\n<td>sparse checkout、shallow clone、fsmonitor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI 时间</td>\n<td>构建测试时间线性增长</td>\n<td>多层缓存、affected-only、时间预算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键认识是<strong>三者会同时出现</strong>：包数量增长时，编辑器、Git 与 CI 一起承压，因此需要并行治理而非逐个击破。治理的抓手是<strong>量化指标与时间预算</strong>——为依赖安装、类型检查、单元测试、构建等阶段设定预算（如总计 &lt; 15min），超出即触发优化；当仓库规模超出 Git 的舒适区时，才考虑 GVFS、Sapling 等专门的大仓工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规模增长的三大瓶颈\">规模增长的三大瓶颈</h2><p>Monorepo 在小规模时运转流畅，但随着代码量和包数量的增长，三个维度会同时出现性能瓶颈：<strong>IDE 性能</strong>（编辑器卡顿、类型检查缓慢）、<strong>Git 性能</strong>（clone/status/log 变慢）和 <strong>CI 时间</strong>（构建和测试时间线性增长）。理解这些瓶颈的成因和解决方案，是 Monorepo 长期可持续的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    SCALE[规模增长] --&gt; IDE[IDE 性能&lt;br/&gt;编辑器卡顿]&#10;    SCALE --&gt; GIT[Git 性能&lt;br/&gt;操作变慢]&#10;    SCALE --&gt; CI[CI 时间&lt;br/&gt;线性增长]&#10;&#10;    IDE --&gt; IDE_S[TypeScript 优化&lt;br/&gt;VS Code 配置]&#10;    GIT --&gt; GIT_S[Sparse Checkout&lt;br/&gt;Shallow Clone]&#10;    CI --&gt; CI_S[增量构建&lt;br/&gt;远程缓存]\">graph TB\n    SCALE[规模增长] --&gt; IDE[IDE 性能&lt;br/&gt;编辑器卡顿]\n    SCALE --&gt; GIT[Git 性能&lt;br/&gt;操作变慢]\n    SCALE --&gt; CI[CI 时间&lt;br/&gt;线性增长]\n\n    IDE --&gt; IDE_S[TypeScript 优化&lt;br/&gt;VS Code 配置]\n    GIT --&gt; GIT_S[Sparse Checkout&lt;br/&gt;Shallow Clone]\n    CI --&gt; CI_S[增量构建&lt;br/&gt;远程缓存]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"ide-性能优化\">IDE 性能优化</h2><h3 id=\"typescript-语言服务优化\">TypeScript 语言服务优化</h3><p>当 Monorepo 中的 TypeScript 文件超过数千个时，VS Code 的 TypeScript 语言服务会变得缓慢。核心优化策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;skipLibCheck&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;incremental&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;disableReferencedProjectLoad&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;disableSolutionSearching&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;assumeChangesOnlyAffectDirectDependencies&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"skipLibCheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"incremental\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"disableReferencedProjectLoad\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"disableSolutionSearching\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"assumeChangesOnlyAffectDirectDependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置项</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>skipLibCheck</code></td>\n<td>跳过 <code>.d.ts</code> 文件的类型检查</td>\n<td>大幅减少检查时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>incremental</code></td>\n<td>增量编译</td>\n<td>只重新检查变更文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>disableReferencedProjectLoad</code></td>\n<td>不自动加载引用项目</td>\n<td>减少内存占用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>disableSolutionSearching</code></td>\n<td>禁用跨项目搜索</td>\n<td>提升编辑器响应速度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"vs-code-workspace-配置\">VS Code Workspace 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;typescript.tsdk&quot;: &quot;node_modules/typescript/lib&quot;,&#10;  &quot;typescript.enablePromptUseWorkspaceTsdk&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;search.exclude&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;**/node_modules&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;**/dist&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;**/.turbo&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;**/.next&quot;: true&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;files.watcherExclude&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;**/node_modules/**&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;**/dist/**&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;**/.turbo/**&quot;: true&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;typescript.preferences.importModuleSpecifier&quot;: &quot;non-relative&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"typescript.tsdk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node_modules/typescript/lib\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"typescript.enablePromptUseWorkspaceTsdk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"search.exclude\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"**/node_modules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"**/dist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"**/.turbo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"**/.next\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"files.watcherExclude\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"**/node_modules/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"**/dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"**/.turbo/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"typescript.preferences.importModuleSpecifier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"non-relative\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 VS Code 的 Multi-root Workspace 功能，只打开当前工作涉及的包，而非整个 Monorepo 根目录，可以显著改善编辑器性能。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"git-性能优化\">Git 性能优化</h2><h3 id=\"shallow-clone\">Shallow Clone</h3><p>限制克隆的历史深度，减少初始克隆时间：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 只克隆最近 1 次提交&#10;git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/org/monorepo.git&#10;&#10;# 如果后续需要更多历史&#10;git fetch --deepen=100&#10;git fetch --unshallow\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只克隆最近 1 次提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --depth</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/monorepo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 如果后续需要更多历史</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --deepen=100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --unshallow</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"sparse-checkout\">Sparse Checkout</h3><p>只检出需要的目录，大幅减少工作目录大小：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 启用 sparse checkout&#10;git clone --filter=blob:none --sparse https://github.com/org/monorepo.git&#10;cd monorepo&#10;&#10;# 只检出需要的目录&#10;git sparse-checkout set \\&#10;  apps/web \\&#10;  packages/ui \\&#10;  packages/utils \\&#10;  packages/types \\&#10;  tooling/&#10;&#10;# 添加更多目录&#10;git sparse-checkout add apps/admin\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 启用 sparse checkout</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter=blob:none</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --sparse</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/monorepo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> monorepo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只检出需要的目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sparse-checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  apps/web</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  packages/ui</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  packages/utils</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  packages/types</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  tooling/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 添加更多目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sparse-checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apps/admin</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"git-性能配置\">Git 性能配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 启用文件系统监控（macOS/Linux）&#10;git config core.fsmonitor true&#10;git config core.untrackedcache true&#10;&#10;# 启用 commit graph 加速 log 操作&#10;git config fetch.writeCommitGraph true&#10;git commit-graph write --reachable&#10;&#10;# 部分克隆（只下载需要的 blob）&#10;git config remote.origin.promisor true&#10;git config remote.origin.partialclonefilter blob:none\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 启用文件系统监控（macOS/Linux）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> core.fsmonitor</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> core.untrackedcache</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 启用 commit graph 加速 log 操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch.writeCommitGraph</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit-graph</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> write</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --reachable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 部分克隆（只下载需要的 blob）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote.origin.promisor</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote.origin.partialclonefilter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> blob:none</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n<th>影响的操作</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Shallow clone</td>\n<td><code>git clone</code></td>\n<td>秒级克隆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sparse checkout</td>\n<td><code>git status</code>, 磁盘占用</td>\n<td>只关注需要的文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fsmonitor</td>\n<td><code>git status</code>, <code>git add</code></td>\n<td>大幅加速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Commit graph</td>\n<td><code>git log</code>, <code>git merge-base</code></td>\n<td>数倍加速</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ci-时间优化\">CI 时间优化</h2><h3 id=\"多层缓存策略\">多层缓存策略</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    CI_START[CI 开始] --&gt; DEP_CACHE{依赖缓存&lt;br/&gt;命中？}&#10;    DEP_CACHE --&gt;|命中| SKIP_INSTALL[跳过安装]&#10;    DEP_CACHE --&gt;|未命中| INSTALL[pnpm install]&#10;    SKIP_INSTALL &amp; INSTALL --&gt; BUILD_CACHE{构建缓存&lt;br/&gt;命中？}&#10;    BUILD_CACHE --&gt;|命中| SKIP_BUILD[跳过构建]&#10;    BUILD_CACHE --&gt;|未命中| BUILD[执行构建]&#10;    SKIP_BUILD &amp; BUILD --&gt; AFFECTED[只测试受影响的包]\">flowchart TD\n    CI_START[CI 开始] --&gt; DEP_CACHE{依赖缓存&lt;br/&gt;命中？}\n    DEP_CACHE --&gt;|命中| SKIP_INSTALL[跳过安装]\n    DEP_CACHE --&gt;|未命中| INSTALL[pnpm install]\n    SKIP_INSTALL &amp; INSTALL --&gt; BUILD_CACHE{构建缓存&lt;br/&gt;命中？}\n    BUILD_CACHE --&gt;|命中| SKIP_BUILD[跳过构建]\n    BUILD_CACHE --&gt;|未命中| BUILD[执行构建]\n    SKIP_BUILD &amp; BUILD --&gt; AFFECTED[只测试受影响的包]</pre><h3 id=\"ci-时间预算\">CI 时间预算</h3><p>为不同阶段设定时间预算，当超出预算时触发优化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>预算</th>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>依赖安装</td>\n<td>&lt; 60s</td>\n<td>pnpm store 缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型检查</td>\n<td>&lt; 120s</td>\n<td>incremental + skipLibCheck</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>&lt; 180s</td>\n<td>affected-only + 并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建</td>\n<td>&lt; 180s</td>\n<td>远程缓存 + 增量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2E 测试</td>\n<td>&lt; 300s</td>\n<td>矩阵并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总计</td>\n<td>&lt; 15min</td>\n<td>所有手段组合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"大型仓库管理工具\">大型仓库管理工具</h2><p>当仓库规模超出 Git 的舒适区时，可以考虑专门的大仓管理工具：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>开发者</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Git VFS (GVFS)</td>\n<td>Microsoft</td>\n<td>虚拟文件系统</td>\n<td>超大规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sapling (sl)</td>\n<td>Meta</td>\n<td>Git 兼容 + 更快操作</td>\n<td>大规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jujutsu (jj)</td>\n<td>Google</td>\n<td>下一代 VCS</td>\n<td>实验性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Git LFS</td>\n<td>GitHub</td>\n<td>大文件管理</td>\n<td>含二进制资源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Sapling - Meta 的 Git 替代品&#10;sl clone https://github.com/org/monorepo.git&#10;sl status&#10;sl commit -m &quot;feat(ui): add new component&quot;&#10;sl push\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Sapling - Meta 的 Git 替代品</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/monorepo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"feat(ui): add new component\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"规模化指标监控\">规模化指标监控</h2><p>持续监控 Monorepo 的规模化指标，在问题变严重之前介入：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;metrics&quot;: &quot;node scripts/collect-metrics.mjs&quot;,&#10;    &quot;metrics:report&quot;: &quot;node scripts/report-metrics.mjs&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"metrics\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node scripts/collect-metrics.mjs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"metrics:report\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node scripts/report-metrics.mjs\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MonorepoMetrics {&#10;  totalPackages: number;&#10;  totalFiles: number;&#10;  totalLines: number;&#10;  avgBuildTime: number;&#10;  cacheHitRate: number;&#10;  ciDuration: number;&#10;  gitCloneTime: number;&#10;  nodeModulesSize: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MonorepoMetrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalPackages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalFiles</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalLines</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  avgBuildTime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cacheHitRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ciDuration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  gitCloneTime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  nodeModulesSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 将关键指标集成到 CI dashboard 中，设置阈值告警。例如当 CI 总时间超过 15 分钟时自动创建优化 issue。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((规模化挑战))&#10;    IDE 性能&#10;      skipLibCheck&#10;      incremental&#10;      Multi-root Workspace&#10;    Git 性能&#10;      Sparse Checkout&#10;      Shallow Clone&#10;      fsmonitor&#10;    CI 时间&#10;      多层缓存&#10;      affected-only&#10;      时间预算&#10;    监控&#10;      规模化指标&#10;      阈值告警&#10;      持续优化\">mindmap\n  root((规模化挑战))\n    IDE 性能\n      skipLibCheck\n      incremental\n      Multi-root Workspace\n    Git 性能\n      Sparse Checkout\n      Shallow Clone\n      fsmonitor\n    CI 时间\n      多层缓存\n      affected-only\n      时间预算\n    监控\n      规模化指标\n      阈值告警\n      持续优化</pre><ul>\n<li>Monorepo 规模化的三大瓶颈是 IDE 性能、Git 性能和 CI 时间</li>\n<li>TypeScript 配置优化（<code>skipLibCheck</code>、<code>incremental</code>）和 VS Code 排除配置可显著改善 IDE 体验</li>\n<li>Git sparse checkout + shallow clone 组合让大仓库的日常操作保持流畅</li>\n<li>CI 时间优化需要多层缓存（依赖缓存 + 构建缓存 + artifacts 共享）的配合</li>\n<li>持续监控规模化指标并设置阈值告警，在问题变严重之前主动介入优化</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"规模化挑战","id":"规模化挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"规模增长的三大瓶颈","id":"规模增长的三大瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"IDE 性能优化","id":"ide-性能优化"},{"level":3,"text":"TypeScript 语言服务优化","id":"typescript-语言服务优化"},{"level":3,"text":"VS Code Workspace 配置","id":"vs-code-workspace-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Git 性能优化","id":"git-性能优化"},{"level":3,"text":"Shallow Clone","id":"shallow-clone"},{"level":3,"text":"Sparse Checkout","id":"sparse-checkout"},{"level":3,"text":"Git 性能配置","id":"git-性能配置"},{"level":2,"text":"CI 时间优化","id":"ci-时间优化"},{"level":3,"text":"多层缓存策略","id":"多层缓存策略"},{"level":3,"text":"CI 时间预算","id":"ci-时间预算"},{"level":2,"text":"大型仓库管理工具","id":"大型仓库管理工具"},{"level":2,"text":"规模化指标监控","id":"规模化指标监控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多仓迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/migration-and-scale/polyrepo-to-monorepo"},"next":{"title":"代码生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/migration-and-scale/code-generation"}}